# CRESST post-freeze sensitivity archives: small (MB-scale) derived
# per-event/bootstrap arrays and run logs kept as a lossless audit trail
# alongside the compact CSV summaries -- not raw detector data, so a narrow
# exception to the repo-wide *.npz/*.log rules above.
!transfer_paper/data/cresst/sensitivity/**/*.npz
!transfer_paper/data/cresst/sensitivity/**/*.log
